	"changenote"		"v0.6.7 — 卡池收束与虫群重做 / Focused card pool and Swarm rework

卡池集中到骨钉、灵魂、虫群召唤三条主线。相对v0.6.6，104种卡牌/101张奖励牌调整为83种/80张奖励牌（22普通、37罕见、21稀有，另有2基础、1衍生），保留25件遗物。本轮退役18张，加上此前去重3张，共21张；中毒及永久囤积格挡转伤害支线退出。

重做17张虫群关联牌的召唤、指令、成长、牺牲和重建配合；初始10张牌包含织者之巢、聚神、复仇之魂。调整蓄能骨钉、暗影祠和蛾翼疾闪，加入原创合成音效和逐次命中特效，并补齐旧卡迁移与提示修正。

旧卡会替换为现役卡，费用和效果可能改变；建议新开一局。需要BaseLib v3.4.7或更新版本。

Focuses builds on Nail, SOUL and Swarm. Compared with v0.6.6, 104 card types / 101 reward cards become 83 types / 80 reward cards (22 Common, 37 Uncommon, 21 Rare, plus 2 basic types and 1 token), with 25 relics. Retires 18 cards in this pass plus 3 earlier duplicates: 21 total, including the Poison and permanent Block-to-damage branches.

Reworks 17 companion-related cards around summoning, commands, growth, sacrifice and recovery. The 10-card starter deck includes Weaver Nest, Focus and Vengeful Spirit. Updates Channelled Nail, Dark Shrine and Mothwing Dash; adds original synthesized audio, hit-timed effects, retired-card migration and tooltip fixes.

Old cards map to current replacements with changed costs and effects. A new run is recommended. Requires BaseLib v3.4.7 or newer."
	"description"		"The Knight — Hollow Knight Character for Slay the Spire 2
Version: v0.6.7

Play as the silent vessel from Hallownest. Strike with your Nail to gather SOUL, spend it on spells and healing, and raise companions to fight beside you.

Content
- 83 card types: 80 reward cards, 2 basic types and the Weaver's Bite token.
- Reward pool: 22 Common, 37 Uncommon and 21 Rare cards.
- 25 exclusive relics, including the starter Soul Catcher.
- English and Simplified Chinese, following the game's language setting.
- Requires BaseLib v3.4.7 or newer. Subscribe to the required BaseLib item.

Three connected build paths
- Nail: multi-hit attacks, Nail strength and charged Nail Arts generate SOUL and deliver damage.
- SOUL: bank resources for bonuses or spend them on spell bursts, healing, card draw and Energy conversion.
- Swarm: summon companions, chain commands, grow their HP, sacrifice them for immediate rewards and rebuild.
Defense, Exhaust and low-HP rewards support these paths. The separate Poison and permanent Block-to-damage branches have been retired.

The SOUL loop
- The starter relic grants 11 SOUL per valid Nail hit. The base SOUL cap is 99, and SOUL carries between turns.
- Most spells cost 33 SOUL in addition to Energy. Spells and companion attacks do not trigger Nail SOUL generation.
- Soul Nourishment separately grants limited SOUL from damaging Weaverling commands and turns actual SOUL spending into companion growth.

Companion summoning
- Weaverling, Grimmchild and Glowing Womb Hatchling have independent HP bars. Each species can have one living companion, with a 24-HP cap.
- Repeated summoning heals and increases maximum HP. Grimmchild's base end-of-turn flame matures from 5 to 8 to 11 damage; maturity does not strengthen commands.
- Weaverling supports multi-hit commands. Hatchlings intercept attacks first and explode on death or sacrifice.
- Your Block absorbs attacks first; one companion then intercepts a hit, with overflow still reaching you.
- Command sequences, HP-based attacks, sacrifice, recovery and SOUL feeding connect the 17 companion-related cards. Grimmchild and Weaversong also summon real companions.

New in v0.6.7
- Refines the published v0.6.6 pool from 104 card types / 101 reward cards to 83 types / 80 rewards. The 18-card structure pass and 3 earlier duplicate removals retire 21 cards in total.
- Reworks companion synergies and gives new runs a 10-card deck: 4 Old Nails, 3 Shells, Weaver Nest, Focus and Vengeful Spirit.
- Gives Channelled Nail a distinct 2-Energy charging role, lets Dark Shrine supply SOUL while defending, and rewards holding at least 66 SOUL with an extra Mothwing Dash draw.
- Adds seven original synthesized combat sounds and hit-timed Nail, SOUL, dive and Void effects, plus Focus and guard feedback. Sound follows the game's volume controls.
- Includes card migration, companion tooltip, SOUL-threshold text and optional audiovisual reliability fixes.

Existing saves
Retired card IDs map to current replacements, which use their own costs and effects. Soul Rush becomes Soul Flow and Void Feast becomes Soul Harvest, both with a base 33-SOUL payment. Redesigned cards also use their new effects. A new run is recommended, especially for old Poison or Barricade builds. Full balance and every old combat-save state have not been exhaustively tested.

简体中文
小骑士 — 空洞骑士角色模组，版本v0.6.7

扮演来自圣巢的小骑士，用骨钉命中积攒灵魂，再用于法术、聚神与伙伴召唤。现有83种卡牌：80张奖励牌（22普通、37罕见、21稀有）、2种基础牌、1种织者之咬衍生牌，以及25件专属遗物。支持简体中文和英文。需要BaseLib v3.4.7或更新版本。

三条构筑主线
- 骨钉：利用多段命中、骨钉增伤和蓄力剑技输出并积攒灵魂。
- 灵魂：在存魂收益与法术爆发之间取舍，用于输出、治疗、抽牌和能量转换。
- 虫群：召唤伙伴、衔接指令、培养生命，再通过攻击、牺牲和复活兑现投入。
防御、消耗和低血收益连接三条主线；独立中毒和永久囤积格挡转伤害路线已退出卡池。

灵魂循环
初始遗物使每次有效骨钉命中获得11灵魂，多数法术额外消耗33灵魂，基础上限99，灵魂可跨回合保留。法术和伙伴攻击不触发骨钉产魂；魂丝哺育另行提供有限的织者指令回魂，并将实际灵魂支付转化为伙伴成长。

虫群召唤
织者幼虫、格林之子和孵化小虫各有独立血条，同种最多存活一只，生命上限24。重复召唤治疗并增加最大生命；格林之子的基础回合末火焰逐步由5提升至8、11，成熟不增强指令。织者擅长多段指令，小虫优先承伤并在阵亡或牺牲时爆炸。玩家先以格挡吸收攻击，再由一只伙伴承伤，溢出伤害仍由玩家承担。17张关联牌覆盖指令、生命转输出、牺牲、回收和灵魂喂养；格林之子、织者之歌也会召唤真实伙伴。

v0.6.7更新
- 相对已发布v0.6.6，从104种卡牌/101张奖励牌收束至83种/80张奖励牌；本轮退役18张，加上此前去重3张，共21张。
- 重做虫群配合；新开局为4旧骨钉、3甲壳、织者之巢、聚神、复仇之魂，共10张。
- 蓄能骨钉承担2能量完整充魂的定位，暗影祠兼顾防御与补魂，蛾翼疾闪奖励持有至少66灵魂时额外抽牌。
- 加入七种原创合成短音效及骨钉、灵魂、俯冲、虚空命中特效，补充聚神和防御反馈，音效跟随游戏音量设置。
- 包含退役卡迁移、虫群提示、灵魂阈值文字及可选音画功能的稳定性修正。

旧存档说明
退役卡会映射为现役替代卡，并采用替代卡的费用和效果。例如魂能激涌改为魂能流转、虚空吞噬改为灵魂收割，均引入基础33灵魂付款；重做卡也会使用新效果。建议新开一局体验，尤其是原中毒、壁垒构筑。完整强度与所有旧战斗存档恢复尚未穷尽验证。

Credits / 致谢
Hollow Knight and its original artwork belong to Team Cherry. This is a fan-made character mod. Original companion, charm and SOUL assets were collected from hollowknight.wiki; additional card art, procedural combat sounds and effects were created for this mod. The Hornet mod informed study of build structure and combat feedback; its code and media are not included.
《空洞骑士》及其原作美术归Team Cherry所有。本作是同人角色模组。伙伴、护符与灵魂原作素材来自hollowknight.wiki；其他卡图、程序合成音效和特效为本模组制作。构筑与战斗反馈参考了对大黄蜂模组的研究，未打包其代码或媒体。"
}
